  "setup_notes": [
    "Press margins are not specified in the workbook. Existing provisional press setup retained: 0.5 in lead, 0.25 in left/right/trail. These side margins exceed the confirmed 3 mm side-trim maximum and must be verified before a valid layout is possible. Finisher side minimum is 0; lead/trail remain provisional.",
